## This repository

`pokebrave-client-otcv8` contains PokéBrave-specific OTCv8 module code
(`modules/game_battlehud/`), tooling (`tools/`), and tests (`tests/`).

All source files in this repository are original PokéBrave contributions.
No upstream OTCv8 or OTClient source files are copied into this repository;
upstream is consumed at runtime as the OTCv8 client binary.

